            "Positive Crankcase Ventilation (PCV) valve operational test",
            "Drive belt inspection or replacement recommendation based on wear",
            "Four-wheel mechanical steering alignment check",
            "Front and rear wiper blade replacement",
            "Comprehensive safety checklist with written component health assessment",
            "Post-service dynamic road test -engine response, braking balance, and transmission shift feel"
        ]
