---

<BaseLayout
    title={pageTitle}
    description={pageDescription}
>
    <!-- Structured JSON-LD Schema Graph -->
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(pageSchema)} />

    <main class="dcrs-service-page">

        <!-- 1. HERO BANNER --------------------------------------------------->
        <header class="dcrs-hero-banner">
            <div class="dcrs-hero-banner__scrim"></div>
            <div class="dcrs-container dcrs-hero-banner__inner">
                <nav class="dcrs-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
                    <ol>
                        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/#service">Services</a></li>
                        <li aria-current="page">Car Maintenance Dubai</li>
                    </ol>
                </nav>
                <span class="dcrs-badge">Al Satwa, Dubai · Basic to Major Servicing · All Makes &amp; Models</span>
                <h1 class="dcrs-hero-banner__title">
                    Car Service Dubai — Scheduled Car Maintenance Packages
                </h1>
                <p class="dcrs-hero-banner__lead">
                    Looking for a dependable car service in Dubai? Our Al Satwa garage provides complete basic, full, and major car maintenance packages for Japanese, European, and American vehicles. Packages start from AED 200 with genuine parts, full diagnostics, and transparent pricing. Open daily 7 AM to 10 PM.
                </p>
                <div class="dcrs-hero-banner__actions">
                    <a href={phoneHref} class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--solid">
                        <Fragment set:html={icons.phone} /> Call {phoneDisplay}
                    </a>
                    <a href={waHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--wa">
                        <Fragment set:html={icons.chat} /> WhatsApp Us
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- 2. INTRO SECTION ------------------------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--paper" id="service-overview">
            <div class="dcrs-container">
                <div class="dcrs-grid-2col dcrs-grid-2col--align-center">
                    
                    <div class="dcrs-intro-content">
                        <div class="dcrs-kicker">Service Overview</div>
                        <h2 class="dcrs-heading__title">
                            Car Service Dubai — Periodic Vehicle Maintenance &amp; Care
                        </h2>
                        <p class="dcrs-lead-text">
                            Standard vehicle maintenance handbooks are engineered for temperate climates. In Dubai, extreme summer heat exceeding 45°C, high humidity, and highway traffic place exceptional stress on lubricants, cooling lines, and electronics. At <a href="/" class="dcrs-inline-link">Dubai Car Repair Service</a>, our car service center Dubai team adapts scheduled intervals to actual Gulf driving conditions. If your service interval is due, you can <a href="/contact" class="dcrs-inline-link">contact us</a> for a transparent quote.
                        </p>
                        <p class="dcrs-body-text">
                            Every scheduled service includes a fresh <a href="/engine-oil-change-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">engine oil change in Dubai</a>, OEM filter replacement, and digital testing of your <a href="/car-battery-replacement-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">car battery in Dubai</a>. We also check wheel condition and provide optical alignment or <a href="/tyre-replacement-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">tyre replacement in Dubai</a> to ensure highway safety, alongside refrigerant checks and <a href="/car-ac-repair-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">car ac repair in Dubai</a> before hot weather sets in.
                        </p>
                        <p class="dcrs-body-text">
                            For vehicles requiring mechanical attention, our certified technicians carry out precision <a href="/car-engine-service-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">car engine service in Dubai</a> and provide a comprehensive <a href="/car-inspection-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">full car check up</a> report. Prefer service at your residence or workplace? Our flexible <a href="/mobile-car-repair-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">mobile car service in Dubai</a> brings scheduled minor maintenance right to your parking bay.
                        </p>

                        <div class="dcrs-action-row">
                            <a href={phoneHref} class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--solid">
                                <Fragment set:html={icons.phone} /> Call Workshop
                            </a>
                            <a href="/contact" class="dcrs-btn dcrs-btn--outline-ink">
                                Book Scheduled Service <Fragment set:html={icons.arrowRight} />
                            </a>
